  <div class="internalpage position-relative">
    <!--<img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/milestone.jpg" class="img-fluid">-->
    <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/our-journey-1920x500-3apr24.webp" class="img-fluid" alt="Our Journey">
    <div class="data d-flex align-items-center">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-md-12">
            <h1 class="text text-light text-uppercase mb-0">Our Journey</h1>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="py-3">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-12 text-justify">
        <p class="mb-2">Beginning as a teacher and crowning his career as the Vice President of Dodsal in Mumbai, D.P. Naiknavare, fondly called Dadasaheb, harboured a profound desire to make positive contributions to his community. In 1986, he translated this dream and foresight into reality by founding Naiknavare Developers, embarking on his entrepreneurial journey along with his sons, Hemant and Ranjit, and daughter-in-law, Gauri. From this humble beginning, a legacy opened up, setting up us as Pune's leading real-estate developers.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-2">At Naiknavare, we are committed to our mission of creating developments that raise lifestyles. While we're trailblazers in the real estate market, we see ourselves as quintessential to the service industry, committed to crafting and turning in living spaces with an objective '' "Not Just Better Housing...But Better Living, For All...". With this in mind, we conceptualize and execute residences where families thrive, careers flourish, and desires take flight.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-2">We recognize that purchasing a home signifies more than just relocating to a new home, we regard consumer-centricity as the cornerstone of our brand. By understanding and acknowledging your needs, we create your dream home by employing the best green creation practices that is not only cost-effective but is also in line with safeguarding the environment.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-2">
          We put our customers at the leading edge of all our endeavours and foster an environment characterized by integrity and dedication with each of our stakeholder’s interaction. We are committed to turning in excellence by blending insights from the past with modern-day technologies. Our overarching purpose is to raise the well-being of society by developing holistic environments that create a life of fulfilment and happiness.</p>
        <p class="mb-2">Beyond crafting the finest residential, commercial and educational properties that distinguish us as Pune's foremost real property developers, we are also devoted to giving back to society. Keeping up to our commitment to the upliftment of the weaker sections of society, we develop residential projects tailor-made to uplift slum dwellers.</p>
        <p class="mb-2">Our aspiration beyond the 60 completed projects spanning across five cities is to create homes, schools, hotels, commercial spaces and business centres that exemplify unwavering quality and endurance.

        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- <section class="py-3">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-12 text-justify">
          <p class="text-2 text-brown text-uppercase mb-0">Legacy</p>
        <p class="mb-2">A Legacy of Trust: Building Homes for Over 3 Decades. Naiknavare Developers has been shaping the cityscape of Pune for over 38 years. Our commitment to excellence has resulted in a remarkable legacy of 18 million square feet of built assets, with a thriving portfolio of over 60 completed projects. We are at the forefront of Pune's real estate development, actively driving the construction of over 3.1 million square feet., and have a vision for the future with a staggering 6 million square feet under planning. </p>
<p class="mb-2">At Naiknavare, we believe in more than just building structures. We build communities, foster dreams, and create lasting value for our customers. Our team of over 300 dedicated professionals is committed to providing exceptional customer service, ensuring a seamless and positive experience throughout your journey with us.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section> -->

